<header>
<h1 class="yidian-title">中国的南海，我们的西沙，航拍实景感受“天空之城——西沙群岛”的独特魅力</h1>
<div class="yidian-info">
<span>文汇网</span> <span>2019-05-24 18:36:02</span> <a id="yidian-toggle-img">显示图片</a>
</div>
</header>
<article>
<div id="yidian-content" class="yidian-content"><p style="text-align:left;display:block;"><span style="caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: arial; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">纯净的沙滩，碧蓝的海水，美丽富饶的西沙群岛。</span>近日，记者搭乘“长乐公主”邮轮前往西沙群岛，通过无人机从高空俯瞰。西沙群岛是中国南海诸岛四大群岛之一，由永乐群岛和宣德群岛构成，是中国南海陆地面积最大的群岛。</p><p style="text-align:center;"><img src="https://wenhui.whb.cn/u/cms/www/201905/241811166zis.jpg" alt="undefined" style="width:645px;height:auto;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; "/></p><p><span style="color: rgb(165, 165, 165);"><span style="caret-color: rgb(165, 165, 165); color: rgb(165, 165, 165); font-family: SimSun, 宋体, " microsoft="" hiragino="" sans="" font-size:="" text-align:="" background-color:="">▲</span>三亚，航拍西沙鸭公岛。</span></p><p style="text-align:center;"><img src="https://wenhui.whb.cn/u/cms/www/201905/241811164soy.jpg" alt="undefined" style="width:645px;height:auto;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; "/></p><p><span style="color: rgb(165, 165, 165);"><span style="caret-color: rgb(165, 165, 165); color: rgb(165, 165, 165); font-family: SimSun, 宋体, " microsoft="" hiragino="" sans="" font-size:="" text-align:="" background-color:="">▲</span>三亚，航拍西沙鸭公岛。</span></p><p style="text-align:center;"><img src="https://wenhui.whb.cn/u/cms/www/201905/2418111606cn.jpg" alt="undefined" style="width:645px;height:auto;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; "/></p><p><span style="color: rgb(165, 165, 165);"><span style="caret-color: rgb(165, 165, 165); color: rgb(165, 165, 165); font-family: SimSun, 宋体, " microsoft="" hiragino="" sans="" font-size:="" text-align:="" background-color:="">▲</span>三亚，航拍西沙鸭公岛。</span></p><p style="text-align:center;"><img src="https://wenhui.whb.cn/u/cms/www/201905/24181116ke9u.jpg" alt="undefined" style="width:645px;height:auto;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; "/></p><p><span style="color: rgb(165, 165, 165);"><span style="caret-color: rgb(165, 165, 165); color: rgb(165, 165, 165); font-family: SimSun, 宋体, " microsoft="" hiragino="" sans="" font-size:="" text-align:="" background-color:="">▲</span>三亚，航拍西沙鸭公岛。</span></p><p style="text-align:center;"><img src="https://wenhui.whb.cn/u/cms/www/201905/24181116vr4m.jpg" alt="undefined" style="width:645px;height:auto;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; "/></p><p><span style="color: rgb(165, 165, 165);"><span style="caret-color: rgb(165, 165, 165); color: rgb(165, 165, 165); font-family: SimSun, 宋体, " microsoft="" hiragino="" sans="" font-size:="" text-align:="" background-color:="">▲</span>三亚，航拍西沙鸭公岛。</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><img src="https://wenhui.whb.cn/u/cms/www/201905/24181116lcoh.jpg" alt="undefined" style="width:645px;height:auto;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; "/></p><p><span style="color: rgb(165, 165, 165);"><span style="caret-color: rgb(165, 165, 165); color: rgb(165, 165, 165); font-family: SimSun, 宋体, " microsoft="" hiragino="" sans="" font-size:="" text-align:="" background-color:="">▲</span>三亚，航拍西沙鸭公岛。</span></p><p><br/><span style="color: rgb(127, 127, 127);font-size:16px">作者：VCG</span><br/><span style="color: rgb(127, 127, 127);font-size:16px">编辑：王梓含</span><br/><span style="color: rgb(127, 127, 127);font-size:16px">责任编辑：刘栋</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(127, 127, 127);font-size:16px">*文汇独家稿件，转载请注明出处。</span></p></div>
